---
/** Shown instead of review data when no staff gateway session matches the Cloudflare Access identity. */
---

<section class="rounded-2xl border border-sand bg-white p-6" aria-labelledby="staff-signin-title">
  <h2 id="staff-signin-title" class="text-lg font-semibold text-charcoal">Staff sign-in required</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
    Review queues need a staff gateway session (staff reviewer or superadmin) that matches your Cloudflare
    Access identity. Sign in on the staff gateway (with REQUIRE_ADMIN_AUTH=true locally, any page shows it),
    then reload this page.
  </p>
</section>
